        <mxCell id="osago-comp" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;fontSize=10;align=left" value="Components:&#xa;• OSAGO Calculator (parallel aggregation)&#xa;• SSE Publisher (real-time updates) 📡&#xa;• Circuit Breaker + Retry logic&#xa;&#xa;External APIs (5 companies):&#xa;• REST: /calculate (timeout: 2s) ⏱&#xa;• Rate Limiting: 100 req/min per company&#xa;• Fallback: cached results&#xa;&#xa;Resilience Patterns:&#xa;🔄 Retry (3 attempts, exp backoff)&#xa;🛡️ Circuit Breaker (5 failures → OPEN)&#xa;⏱️ Timeout (2s per company)&#xa;🚦 Rate Limiting (token bucket)" vertex="1">
